  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Career Support Camilla &#xc5;berg 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S&#xe4;ckpengsbidrag Camilla &#xc5;berg 2013-06-11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I enlighet med Strategin f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling och utbyten         2011--2013 kan CAPDEV ge l&#xf6;nebidrag &#xe5;t deltagare i                    resursbasprogrammen, som vid hemkomsten tioll Sverige &#xe4;r arbetsl&#xf6;sa,  under max 5 m&#xe5;nader f&#xf6;r att underl&#xe4;tta &#xe5;terintr&#xe4;det p&#xe5; den svenska    arbetsmarknaden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In accordance with the Strategy for capactiy development and          exchanges CAPDEV can give a salary support to participants of the     resource base programmes, who, at the arrival in Sweden are           unemployed, during a maximum of 5 months to help the entry into the   Swedish labour market.</narrative>
  </description>
